  "implementation_notes": [
    "Continue processing the complete existing total ordinal source/output plan. Get-WinImgDuplicateKey uses invariant lowercase filename, invariant LastWriteTimeUtc ticks and input length in an Ordinal dictionary, retaining a separate first success for each length.",
    "Remove early seen-key registration. Register only after validated image output has been moved to its final name, or a staged stable video copy has finalized without replacement. Failed conversions/copies/finalization do not retain duplicate entries.",
